78/status/1826873843727958347"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-21T05:13:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1826125535627587780"],"id":"1826125535627587780","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":115740,"like_count":54,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天新面试的女孩子真的好可爱啊...🥹 https://t.co/Bf7O4AMl9t","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1826125535627587780"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-21T05:06:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1826123782559502759"],"id":"1826123782559502759","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":97,"impression_count":122104,"like_count":144,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":12},"text":"除了吉原 川崎 薄野 国分町  栄町 桜町 西川口  金津园 雄琴 福原 中州 中央街\n这几个地方的泡泡浴质量还说得过去之外，\n其他地区的泡泡浴感兴趣的大致了解一下得了。\n是真的没法玩... https://t.co/bapOoCUmUy","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1826123782559502759"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-20T01:58:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1825713882696134818"],"id":"1825713882696134818","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":144,"impression_count":239588,"like_count":369,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":26},"text":"不清楚什么时候开始，各个国家的私密高端游的定义就非要和这个国家的色情的产业挂钩到一起...似乎去了不嫖一下，这团就高端不起来一样。\n而且好多人仅仅是知道个泡泡浴，知道个大久保，知道个出会咖啡，找个AV女优拍摄就可以把自己包装成高端游导游... https://t.co/YNkW74csuj","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1825713882696134818"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-19T03:27:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1825374118050672877"],"id":"1825374118050672877","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":123065,"like_count":102,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":4},"text":"分辨推上真福利姬还是皮下男最好的办法，\n就是真福利姬说不出那么骚的话...🙂","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1825374118050672877"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-18T04:32:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1825028035478966272"],"id":"1825028035478966272","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":227,"impression_count":276966,"like_count":597,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":24},"text":"说实在的尽管有风俗营业法在规范着，但日本很多店铺还是可以把服务的尺度无限放大。半套店做全套甚至NS都是有可能的。但这种情况多发生于在店铺“毫不知情”的前提下所产生的技师个人行为。\n很多日本妹子为了提高指名率或是赚取小费，或是单纯的想自我满足，从而在半套店为客人提供全套的性爱服务。 https://t.co/CEsIuYAoUz","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1825028035478966272"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-17T14:30:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1824816052733391167"],"id":"1824816052733391167","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":71,"impression_count":369273,"like_count":324,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":6},"text":"现在大阪的角色扮演的店铺都接待外国人了啊😂😂还挺有意思 https://t.co/X7HAXzbH2Z","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1824816052733391167"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-17T09:51:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1824745749709750496"],"id":"1824745749709750496","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":18,"impression_count":150059,"like_count":105,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":6},"text":"日本真的是，从小就培养啊...😂😂 https://t.co/pIyHSQU3Wv","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1824745749709750496"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-16T12:55:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1824429849978736960"],"id":"1824429849978736960","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":99546,"like_count":46,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我现在一个推广也不敢接...\n我粉丝真的...你让他买啥他都会买...","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1824429849978736960"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-15T14:31:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1824091623200117200"],"id":"1824091623200117200","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":46,"impression_count":243726,"like_count":382,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":58,"retweet_count":8},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1738073265502036372","type":"quoted"}],"text":"近期这姐们又资金紧张了...😅 https://t.co/TyCDBwfVAC","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1824091623200117200"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-15T10:14:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1824026985720692809"],"id":"1824026985720692809","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":106544,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":4},"text":"记得19年的时候流行过一种骗术，就是附近的人或是交友软件加到的女孩子，会让约她们的客人去便利店买一种点卡的东西，然后把点卡的密码告诉他们当做约炮的保证金。\n这种骗局一直持续了很久，也有很多人上当受骗。\n有很多比较聪明人在遇到这种情况时候，会主动先问过我，我就跟他们说这些是骗子。 https://t.co/GSZCTm0mJn","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1824026985720692809"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-15T00:45:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1823883702361116949"],"id":"1823883702361116949","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":31,"impression_count":168203,"like_count":192,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":5},"text":"一般推特上约的福利姬线下都不是本人，\n一般都是一个负责拍图发图，\n然后找和自己毫不相关的妹子去接客人，\n一般拍图P的多美，线下接客的就有多吓人...\n日本的福利姬也这样操作...\n没想到前几天约出来一个真实本人，\n反而显得愈发珍贵了...🙂","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1823883702361116949"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-14T13:08:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1823708160479404229"],"id":"1823708160479404229","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":93314,"like_count":50,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"福岛的小名浜的泡泡浴，应该是我见过最接地气最有烟火气的泡泡浴了...😂 https://t.co/inttgfqSZ5","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1823708160479404229"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-13T12:01:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1823329061835599882"],"id":"1823329061835599882","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":45,"impression_count":212776,"like_count":131,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":3},"text":"好多AV公司的经纪跟我说让我注意一个中介，说他一直私下加他们的AV女优然后直接介绍给客人。还说他一直到处在搞我。 https://t.co/8fi3qS8Pri","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1823329061835599882"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-08-12T02:00:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1822815360804131042"],"id":"1822815360804131042","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":76,"impression_count":196624,"like_count":185,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":27,"retweet_count":10},"text":"我是万万没想到中文区的资源居然能有这么强大...😳😳😳 https://t.co/0I2aQhXBVx","url":"https://x.com/iam678/s